    "name": "longbridge-value-investing",
    "description": "Value investing analysis using Graham (NCAV/net-net/defensive-investor) and Buffett (economic moat/ROE/FCF) methodologies. Covers single-stock diagnostics and batch screening for both Graham cigar-butt and Buffett quality-compounder criteria. Runs cross-statement reconciliation before scoring. Data from Longbridge CLI first, MCP fallback, WebSearch only for genuine gaps.\nTriggers: \"格雷厄姆\", \"巴菲特\", \"捡烟蒂\", \"烟蒂股\", \"NCAV\", \"净流动资产\", \"护城河\", \"价值投资\", \"安全边际\", \"深度价值\", \"撿煙蒂\", \"煙蒂股\", \"淨流動資產\", \"護城河\", \"安全邊際\", \"Graham\", \"Buffett\", \"cigar butt\", \"net-net\", \"NCAV screen\", \"moat\", \"value investing\", \"margin of safety\", \"deep value\", \"quality compounder\", \"價值投資\", \"深度價值\", \"防御型投资者\", \"防禦型投資者\"\n",
